{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n212.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"8","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/genesis_8_1/genesis_8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/genesis_8_1/genesis_8/1","n":"1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:genesis/8/1"}}
{"text":"‘God remembered Noah and all the beasts and all the cattle that were with him in the ark, and God caused a wind to pass over the earth and the waters subsided’."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"And it was said:  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"2","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/exodus_2_24/exodus_2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/exodus_2_24/exodus_2/24","n":"24"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:exodus/2/24"}}
{"text":"‘God heard their cry, then God remembered His covenant with Abraham, Isaac and Jacob’."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"And it was said:  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"26","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/leviticus_26_42/leviticus_26"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/leviticus_26_42/leviticus_26/42","n":"42"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:leviticus/26/42"}}
{"text":"‘I will remember my covenant with Jacob, as well as my covenant with Isaac and my covenant with Abraham will I also remember, and the land will I remember.’"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"And in Thy holy words it is written:  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"111","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/psalms_111_4/psalms_111"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/psalms_111_4/psalms_111/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/111/4"}}
{"text":"‘A memorial has He made for His wonders, gracious and compassionate is the Lord’."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"And it was said:  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"111","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/psalms_111_5/psalms_111"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/psalms_111_5/psalms_111/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/111/5"}}
{"text":"‘He gave food to those that fear Him, He will remember His covenant for ever’."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"And it was said:  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"106","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/psalms_106_45/psalms_106"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/psalms_106_45/psalms_106/45","n":"45"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/106/45"}}
{"text":"‘He remembered unto them His covenant and He reversed the decree according to the abundance of His kindness’."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"And through Thy servants the prophets it is written saying:  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"2","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/jeremiah_2_2/jeremiah_2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/jeremiah_2_2/jeremiah_2/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:jeremiah/2/2"}}
{"text":"‘Go and proclaim in the ears of Jerusalem saying, "}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:sic","attrs":{}}
{"text":"‘Thus"}
{"end":"t:sic"}
{"start":"t:corr","attrs":{}}
{"text":"Thus"}
{"end":"t:corr"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"tail":" says the Lord: I remember unto you the grace of your youth, the love of your betrothal, when you followed me in the wilderness in land unsown’."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"And it was said:  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"16","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/ezekiel_16_60/ezekiel_16"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/ezekiel_16_60/ezekiel_16/60","n":"60"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:ezekiel/16/60"}}
{"text":"‘I will remember My covenant with you in the days of your youth and establish with you an everlasting covenant’."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"And it was said:  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"31","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/jeremiah_31_19/jeremiah_31"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/zikhronot_verses/quotes/jeremiah_31_19/jeremiah_31/19","n":"19"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:jeremiah/31/19"}}
{"text":"‘Is Ephraim a dear son to me, or a delightful child that whenever I speak of him, I still remember him? Accordingly, my love for him is aroused, I shall surely have compassion on him, says the Lord’."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
